  "body": "## Purpose\n\nAdjudicate exact restricted claim UC-WP07-P006 from work package UC-WP07-D005 in campaign UC-001.\n\n## Exact Subject\n- theorem merge: dbfbb117ef1e3733268da6590c824a330c69ee64\n- theorem file: MathSolve/UnionClosed/FunctionalPreorderD005.lean\n- theorem blob: 5638ddb60e573a7416a844ece74234fcffba52ad\n- handoff merge: 0eef2146588d10953ffc29dede7614d66ca2c0b7\n- packet blob: 1d6365df8c6178ed4b22eb9531a9220cd13bbf24\n- principal theorem: MathSolve.UnionClosed.WP07.d005_complement_frankl\n- companion theorem: MathSolve.UnionClosed.WP07.d005_complement_averageAbundant\n\n## Disposition\nQUALIFIED under bounded restricted scope.\nUniversal bridge UC-P04 remains OPEN.\nFrankl's conjecture UC-FRANKL remains OPEN_PROBLEM.",
